New dwellings on an unadopted estate road need a **full plans application**. An unadopted estate road is a private street. Under reg 12(4), erecting a building that fronts a private street must go through full plans, so a building notice cannot be used. New dwellings are not Schedule 3 competent-person work and are not exempt.

The clauses supplied (reg 12(7) and ADL1 paragraphs 0.6 and 10.1) do not change this routing.

